nss-clients: reserve modern IGS actions before interface configuration

Move action lookup/allocation ahead of NSS side effects, and unwind the
acquired action on every subsequent failure. Reuse bound actions without
configuring another mapping. Unfinished new actions own no device.

This fixes action admission only. Firmware transaction compensation and
registration ownership remain separate unresolved contracts.

